Every *.pub file in this directory is a trusted superfind release key, in
minisign's public key format. superfind embeds this directory, so a key added
here is trusted by every build from then on, and a key removed here is
trusted by no new build.

Make a key with

  go run ./internal/release/cmd/keygen ~/superfind-release.key > internal/release/keys/superfind-2026.pub

CONTRIBUTING.md has the full steps.
